WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.062
Meet Bayit. A warm home app for the whole family.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.070
A little more together.

3
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:11.813
Today brings the whole family's day onto one calm page.

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.766
And reminders find you, right on your phone.

5
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.850
The calendar shows everyone's week, each person in their own colour.

6
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.587
Every task has an owner, and the kids' routines earn them points.

7
00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:29.590
One shared shopping list, so anyone can grab what's missing.

8
00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:35.066
Kids get their own pixel heroes, to care for, dress up and play with.

9
00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:38.952
Your family's own Telegram bot sends the reminders.

10
00:00:38.922 --> 00:00:40.992
Tap Done, and it's done.

11
00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.030
Or simply tell it what you need.

12
00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:48.188
It prepares the change, and nothing happens until you tap Apply.

13
00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:53.580
Every family runs its own copy, with its own accounts and keys.

14
00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:57.899
Bayit. Free, open source, and all yours.
